{"text": "After searching, I found several relevant papers and concepts related to conformal prediction for time series. The core concept involves providing a measure of uncertainty in predictions, which is crucial for applications requiring reliable forecasts. Recent developments include specific applications in clustering multivariate time series and combining with Gaussian process regression for forecasting. Benchmark datasets are essential but not widely standardized yet. There are no recent survey papers on this topic available.\n\nTotal number of sources: 10\n\nSummary:\n- Core concept involves uncertainty quantification.\n- Recent application in clustering multivariate time series.\n- Combining with Gaussian process regression shows promise.\n- Need for benchmark datasets.", "token_logprobs": [-1.4861273765563965, -1.0931239128112793, -0.15896955132484436, -0.7471373677253723, -0.055063530802726746, -0.6289003491401672, -0.3211982548236847, -0.15163861215114594, -0.10895931720733643, -0.7854365706443787, -1.2611281871795654, -2.622607780722319e-06, -0.0008718594908714294, 0.0, -3.57628505298635e-06, -0.003126257797703147, -2.2649790025752736e-06, -0.00014198834833223373, -1.4705986976623535, -1.0152206420898438, -1.5637375116348267, -0.04306373745203018, -0.2659158408641815, -1.7249956130981445, -1.4856061935424805, -1.9252467155456543, -4.1485694964649156e-05, -0.0628504827618599, -1.4762754440307617, -0.05510717257857323, -0.12394402921199799, -1.9405349493026733, -0.18084558844566345, -0.5032320618629456, -0.004167466890066862, -0.872697114944458, -0.23532545566558838, -0.2083914428949356, -0.9366158843040466, -0.014523257501423359, -0.08373882621526718, -0.1654248833656311, -0.23599305748939514, -0.6373994946479797, -0.009617293253540993, -0.28472545742988586, -1.0490224361419678, -2.432547092437744, -3.337865791763761e-06, -0.0006275357445701957, -7.987054232216906e-06, -0.11437686532735825, -0.18916462361812592, -2.45243501663208, -0.021921690553426743,